  "body": "Step into this brick and tile home and discover a warm, practical setting designed to adapt beautifully to modern family life. The property is situated on 403sqm (approx. ) land, with a well-considered 250sqm (approx.) floor area, and features a total of 3 living areas, 4 bedrooms, and 3 bathrooms, providing exceptional space and flexibility for growing families. Enjoy elevated sea views from the kitchen, upstairs living area, and master bedroom, offering a beautiful outlook and a lovely sense of connection to the surrounding coastal landscape. Thoughtfully refreshed with a fresh coat of paint and new carpet throughout, the home presents a bright, fresh, and inviting feel from the moment you step inside.\r\n\r\nAt the heart of the home, the open-plan kitchen, dining, and living area creates a welcoming space for everyday family life and entertaining. The kitchen is designed with both style and practicality in mind, featuring a central island, quality appliances, generous cabinetry and a dedicated pantry, providing valuable storage and keeping the main cooking area neat and organised.\r\n\r\nThe ground floor offers excellent flexibility for changing family needs. A comfortable bedroom provides a private space for guests, extended family, or teenagers, while a family bathroom adds everyday convenience and privacy. There is also a separate lounge, offering valuable additional living space and the flexibility to be converted into a fifth bedroom when extra accommodation is required. Two heat pumps on this level ensure a comfortable environment throughout the year.\r\n\r\nThe outdoor deck extends the living space outdoors, providing a versatile area for alfresco dining, family gatherings, weekend entertaining, or simply relaxing with a coffee while enjoying the fresh air. \r\n\r\nUpstairs, an additional living area offers another comfortable space for relaxing, watching a movie, or enjoying some quiet family time. Sliding doors open this living area onto a private balcony, creating an easy indoor-outdoor connection and a pleasant spot to enjoy some fresh air.\r\n\r\nThe master bedroom provides a comfortable private retreat and features its own ensuite and walk-in wardrobe, while two additional bedrooms are serviced by a modern family bathroom with a bathtub. Central air-conditioning ensures year-round comfort across the upper level.\r\n\r\nDouble internal-access garage provides secure parking , with convenient direct access to the home and plenty of room for everyday storage.\r\n\r\nYou're in the heart of Silverdale, close to everyday shopping and groceries, Silverdale Shopping Centre, KingsWay School, Silverdale Primary School, while Orewa Beach is only a short drive away, combining lifestyle, convenience, and family-friendly living. \r\n\r\nWell positioned for convenient family living, this home offers a practical combination of space, flexibility, and comfort, with the added benefit of being move-in ready following its recent refresh.\r\n\r\nWhether you need room for a growing family, space for guests and extended family, or simply want a home that can adapt as your needs change, this versatile brick residence offers plenty of possibilities.\r\n\r\nContact Team Sabrina today to arrange your private viewing.",
